; A7 query interface (specs/plans/incremental-codegen-cas-plan.md §12):
; `march query <sub> ...` answers questions about one compile from the
; pipeline's own state.  The driver (bin/main.ml) feeds it; this library holds
; the requests, the snapshot collector, the cache-key record and the answers.
(library
 (name march_query)
 (libraries march_tir march_cas march_ast yojson unix))
